msgid "A steaming-hot spiced beverage served in a decorative Starlight mug. Notes of Lominsan citrus.<br><br>※Cannot be retrieved once used.<br>※Can be used up to 10 times.<br><br>Meal benefits when used:<br>  <ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Piety Bonus:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> +4% (Max 10)<br>  <ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>VIT Bonus:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> +5% (Max 12)<br>  <ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Gear Durability Bonus:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> +3<br>  <ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>EXP Bonus:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> +3%<br>  <ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 30m<br>  (Duration can be extended to 60m by consuming multiple servings)"
