#. fr: fiole d'agent renforçant de la foudre vive
#. column 2: pots of evercharged ester
#. column 8: An immutable chemical mixture synthesized with advanced Everkeep technology. Applying it to historia weapons enables full optimization of the gear's offensive properties.
